{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"菩薩戒本羯磨校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"一．是書校歴二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"二．譯校凡用五種異本。（一）藏文本勝友等譯菩薩地初持瑜伽處戒品．略稱藏本。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"（二）北涼曇無讖譯菩薩地持經戒品．〈別出菩薩戒本〉略稱地持。（三）劉宋求那跋","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"摩譯菩薩善戒經戒品．略稱善戒。〈以上三種異譯〉（四）藏文本智鎧等譯德光造菩","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"薩戒品釋．略稱德光釋。（五）藏文本勝友智鎧等譯勝子造菩薩戒品大疏．略稱","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"勝子疏。〈以上二種註釋〉","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"三．譯校對勘凡有四事。（一）諸本文句詳略具缺不同者．皆註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"諸本譯義較爲明暢正確者．註出曰．勘某本雲雲。（三）註書解釋可資參證者．亦","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"註出曰．某釋雲雲。（四）因此對勘而見今譯未愜者．幷加按語曰．今譯雲雲。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"四．刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對校麗刻訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"五．刊本款式．戒本各戒分段排列．幷註出序數。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"六．校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"(一)藏文本菩薩地初持瑜伽處戒品．byan%-chubsems-dpah!isah!igshih!i","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"rnal-h!byor-gyignas-lastshul-khrims-kyileh!u．德格版丹珠．經解部wi字","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"函．七三頁下至一○一頁下。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"(二)菩薩地持經戒品．","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"(三)菩薩善戒經戒品．以上二種金陵刻經處刊會譯本。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"(四)藏文本德光菩薩戒品釋．byan%-chubsems-dpah!itshul-khrims-kyileh!u-","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"h!ibc#ad-pa．德格版丹珠．經解部h!i字函．一八八頁下至一九七頁上。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"(五)藏文本勝子菩薩戒品大疏．byan%-chubsems-dpah!itshul-khrims-kyile-","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"h!uh!irgya-cherh!grel-pa．同函一九七頁上至二二七頁上。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_96_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_96","text":"(六)本書南宋刻麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本校","sortOrder":24}],"overrides":{}}